e (selftests/mock_gem_device.c:198)\n   - Call sites: 10 selftest setup functions spanning 10 files; need the enclosing function names.\n\nCall cycles: i915_driver_probe → i915_driver_register → drm_dev_register — no cycle. No cycles anywhere (all are one-way trees).\n\nNext, get the enclosing function names of the mock_gem_device call sites. 10 files, one call each. Grep each with an ERE that gives the line numbers of definitions and the mock line. Batch with 5+5."}}
